    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Traditional Two Storey Dwelling situated in a private and peaceful location, which enjoys excellent views of the Mount Brandon Range. The property which is approximately a 10 minute drive from Dingle Town and approximately a 5 minute drive from Ballydavid Village. Accommodation comprises of a Hallway, Living Room, Utility Room, Bathroom & Kitchen on the Ground Floor. The 1st Floor comprises of a Landing, 4 Bedrooms & a Toilet."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\nHallway\t4.65\tx\t2.08\tLinoleum Floor; Wooden Ceiling\r\nLiving Room\t4.28\tx\t3.76\tCarpet Floor; Open Fireplace\r\nUtility Room\t3.29\tx\t1.43\tLinoleum Floor\r\nBathroom\t3.23\tx\t1.80\tTile Floor; WC, WHB, Bath; Shower Unit\r\nKitchen\t4.21\tx\t2.56\tTiled Floor; Fitted Kitchen\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nLanding\t3.13\tx\t0.87\tCarpet Floor; Wooden Ceiling\r\nBedroom 1\t3.39\tx\t2.33\tCarpet Floor; Wooden Ceiling\r\nBedroom 2\t4.31\tx\t2.47\tCarpet Floor; Wooden Ceiling\r\nBedroom 3\t3.33\tx\t3.22\tCarpet Floor\r\nToilet\tIncl. Above\tLinoleum Floor, WC, WHB\r\nBedroom 4\t4.26\tx\t2.64\tCarpet Floor; Wooden Ceiling"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "\tTraditional Two Storey Dwelling\r\n\tExcellent views of the Mount Brandon Range & Surrounding Countryside.\r\n\tDouble Glazed PVC & Wooden Windows & Solid Wooden Door\r\n\tOil Fired Central Heating\r\n\tConcrete Driveway\r\n\tDetached Garden Shed\r\n\tConvenient to many amenities in area incl. Feoghnach Primary School and Community Hall, Brandon Creek. Carraig Church \r\n\tApproximately 8 miles from Dingle Town & 2 miles to Ballydavid Village\r\n\tMains Water & Septic Tank\r\n\tPrivate, Peaceful & Scenic Location\r\n\tFull Fibre Broadband available nearby"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Leaving Dingle on the coast road, you will approach Milltown roundabout. Continue straight out taking the Feoghnach road for about 6 miles: continuing on the main road keeping left at the junction for Brandon Creek, continue on the main road for Feoghnach. Tale a left turn off at the next set of crossroads: As you approach a T-Junction take a right turn: Continue down this road a short distance and the property is the first house on the left hand side of the public road."
      }
